WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome back.
-I'm upset.

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.469 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Upset about?

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.237
-That you would have me on
the show with Fred Savage,

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
for crying out loud.
-Why --

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have beef with
Fred Savage.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is your beef
with Fred Savage?

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.809 line:92%
-I have this rare moment.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
I get to go to Comic-Con.
-Yes.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This was amazing for me,
because --

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.280 line:92%
-This is out in San Diego.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I literally became
a Pac-10 football player

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:19.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
just to compensate for
the fact that I'm a huge nerd.

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:20.387 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gotcha, right.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:21.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just want to have some
balance in my life.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm walking through
crowded Comic-Con,

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
and somebody comes up to me,
"Mr. Booker,

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fred Savage would like you
to have this."

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:30.196 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I turn around, and it'
a pair of sunglasses.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm like, who does this gu
think he is?

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.534 line:92%
He's literally giving me shade

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
And --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or maybe he thinks
he's such a big star --

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.206
I've never met the guy -- that I
need sunglasses to view him.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-And so I look around.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:42.709 line:92%
I go, "Where is Fred Savage?

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
They said, "Well, he would
like to see you."

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:47.180
And I tried to find him, but I
couldn't connect with the guy.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I just see him...
-Wow.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...as one of these stars --
-How do you think I feel?

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:53.386
I've met him multiple times.
He's never given me anything

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
You should feel lucky
that you were --

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I thought we were going
to have a moment backstage

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:59.426
but he did not even --
-He didn't even want to see you.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:00.527 line:92%
So you did go to Comic-Con

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:02.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
These are not the sunglasses
