00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:03.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Those were not.
-Okay, got it.

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.866
-Those are virtual -- that i
actually our taxpayer dollars.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:07.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-That's NASA.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And they were showing peopl

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:12.238
